## install


the official cli is available from homebrew and npm:

```bash
brew install kernel/tap/kernel
# or
npm install -g @onkernel/cli
```

install the typescript sdk with `npm install @onkernel/sdk`. python and go sdks are linked from the documentation.

## brand

write the name as KERNEL, all caps. do not write Kernel, kernel, or Kernel.sh as a name. machine-readable strings keep their own casing: kernel.sh, api.onkernel.com, @onkernel/sdk, @onkernel/cli, github.com/kernel, and the `kernel` cli command.

- [brand assets and naming guidelines](https://www.kernel.sh/brand-assets)

